  "source_text": "Medal of Military Duty Medal instituted in 1969. Medal awarded to members of the armed forces, regardless of rank, for faithful and courageous performance of non-combattant duty. Medal have III classes. There are two types of the medal: the Libyan Arab Republic from 1969 to 1979 and the Socialist People's Libyan Arab Jamahiriya from 1979 to 2011. The medal have similar design with Egyptian medal . Libyan Arab Republic",
